<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>New Support Ticket</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f4f4;">
<table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" bgcolor="#f4f4f4" style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f4f4;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">
<tr><td align="center">
<table width="920" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" bgcolor="#ffffff" style="max-width:920px;">

<tr><td height="12" bgcolor="#002b8f"></td></tr>

<tr><td align="center" style="padding:30px 20px;background:#ffffff;">
<img src="https://myfrequentrewards.com/images/logo/mfr-logo.png" alt="MyFrequentRewards" width="520" style="display:block;max-width:100%;" />
</td></tr>

<tr><td height="1" bgcolor="#fe7e00"></td></tr>

<tr><td style="padding:35px 60px 15px;">
<p style="margin:0 0 25px;font-size:28px;color:#0d2372;font-weight:bold;">New Support Ticket</p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:38px;color:#14245d;">A new support ticket has been created by a MyFrequent<span style="color:#fe7e00;">Rewards</span> panel user. Please review the ticket details below and take the necessary action.</p>
</td></tr>

<tr><td style="padding:30px 55px;">
<table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="border:1px solid #d7e4ff;border-radius:12px;background:#f8fbff;">

<tr><td colspan="2" style="padding:25px 30px;border-bottom:1px solid #d7e4ff;">
<h2 style="margin:0;color:#0d2372;font-size:28px;">Ticket Information</h2>
</td></tr>

<tr>
<td width="220" style="padding:20px 30px 10px;color:#0d2372;font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;">Name</td>
<td style="padding:20px 30px 10px 0;color:#22305f;font-size:18px;">{{ user.name }}</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td width="220" style="padding:10px 30px;color:#0d2372;font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;">Email</td>
<td style="padding:10px 30px 10px 0;color:#22305f;font-size:18px;">{{ user.email }}</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td width="220" style="padding:10px 30px;color:#0d2372;font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;">Ticket No.</td>
<td style="padding:10px 30px 10px 0;color:#22305f;font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;">{{ data.ticketNo }}</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td width="220" style="padding:10px 30px 20px;color:#0d2372;font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;">Subject</td>
<td style="padding:10px 30px 20px 0;color:#22305f;font-size:18px;">{{ data.subject }}</td>
</tr>

</table>
</td></tr>

<tr><td style="padding:0 55px 35px;">
<table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="background:#fef8f2;border:1px solid #f0d7b4;border-radius:10px;">
<tr>
<td width="120" align="center" style="padding:25px;">
<img src="https://frequentresearch.com/mailer/mail-icons/mfr/mail.png" width="85" alt="Support Ticket" style="display:block;" />
</td>
<td style="padding:25px 25px 25px 0;">
<h3 style="margin:0 0 10px;color:#0d2372;font-size:22px;">Action Required</h3>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:30px;color:#22305f;">Please review the ticket and respond to the panel user as soon as possible. If additional information is required, follow up with the user using the contact details provided above.</p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td></tr>

<tr><td style="padding:15px 55px;border-top:1px solid #ddd;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;">
<table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
<tr>

<td align="center" style="padding:8px;">
<img src="https://frequentresearch.com/mailer/icons/phone.png" alt="Phone" width="30" height="30" style="border:0;display:block;margin-bottom:8px;" />
<a href="tel:+919810459700" style="color:#000;text-decoration:none;font-size:16px;">+91 98104 59700</a>
</td>

<td align="center" style="padding:8px;border-left:2px solid #ddd;">
<img src="https://frequentresearch.com/mailer/icons/email.png" alt="Email" width="30" height="30" style="border:0;display:block;margin-bottom:8px;" />
<a href="mailto:support@myfrequentrewards.com" style="color:#000;text-decoration:none;font-size:16px;">support@myfrequentrewards.com</a>
</td>

<td align="center" style="padding:8px;border-left:2px solid #ddd;">
<img src="https://frequentresearch.com/mailer/icons/internet.png" alt="Website" width="30" height="30" style="border:0;display:block;margin-bottom:8px;" />
<a href="https://www.myfrequentrewards.com" style="color:#000;text-decoration:none;font-size:16px;">www.myfrequentrewards.com</a>
</td>

</tr>
</table>
</td></tr>

<tr><td align="center" style="padding:35px 20px 20px;">
<p style="margin:0;color:#333;font-size:18px;">With Regards,</p>
<p style="margin:10px 0;color:#0d2372;font-size:34px;font-weight:bold;">My Frequent Rewards Team</p>
<p style="margin:0;color:#666;font-size:22px;">A Frequent Research Survey Panel</p>
</td></tr>

<tr><td align="center">
<table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
<tr><td width="60" height="2" bgcolor="#fe7e00"></td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr>

<tr><td align="center" style="padding:30px 20px 50px;">

<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/my-frequent-rewards" style="text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;margin-left:10px;">
<img src="https://frequentresearch.com/mailer/icons/linkedin.png" alt="LinkedIn" width="30" height="30" style="border:0;display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;" />
</a>

<a href="https://www.facebook.com/FrequentResearchFieldwork/" style="text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;margin-left:10px;">
<img src="https://frequentresearch.com/mailer/icons/facebook.png" alt="Facebook" width="30" height="30" style="border:0;display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;" />
</a>

<a href="https://twitter.com/frequentrfs/" style="text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;margin-left:10px;">
<img src="https://frequentresearch.com/mailer/icons/twitter.png" alt="Twitter/X" width="30" height="30" style="border:0;display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;" />
</a>

</td></tr>

<tr><td height="10" bgcolor="#fe7e00"></td></tr>

</table>
</td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
